{"about_the_game":"Alicemare is a somehow familiar yet totally unique adventure game with strong horror leanings, created by \u25b3\u25cb\u25a1\u00d7 (Miwashiba) using the WOLF RPG Editor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >~STORY~</h2><br>Allen is a young boy who has lost his memory.<br>Bereaved by the loss of his mother and father, he eventually ends up at a home for lost children.<br>One day, he sets out to investigate a rumor heard from the other children. This is where Allen\u2019s story really begins...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >~WHAT KIND OF A GAME?~</h2><br>Alicemare is an adventure game blending elements of exploration, storybooks and fairytales, and just a hint of horror.<br>Those with an aversion to horror need not worry; this title only includes subtle touches of the genre here and there.<br>There are no survival-horror elements to the gameplay nor the story, and you can rest assured that the only thing keeping you up at night will be your enjoyment of the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >~CHARACTERS~</h2>\u25c6Allen <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/402c8dc5a9a2b879755313c82987dcc3.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span> <br>A young boy who has tragically lost both his memory and his parents.<br>He likes books and newspapers.<br><br>\u25c6Letty &amp; Rick <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/b0fd0dae33d95d7105a6ba483265ea3e.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/775a8ef68143b81a4a6eb6ad6a219148.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span> <br>Letty is a young girl with a bright and energetic personality.<br>Rick, her twin, is a boy who looks exactly like Letty.<br><br>\u25c6Chelsy <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/6396a84258b0dd5d494b90e92cf99dca.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><br>A shy little girl.<br>Chelsy loves her teddy bears.<br><br>\u25c6Joshua <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/0368212e7d163e7ca65076538205a03e.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><br>A mischievous young boy who likes to cause trouble.<br>Joshua is currently obsessed with frogs.<br><br>\u25c6Stella <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/d35d5f48bdf9dea234294606e4adafe3.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><br>A curious little girl with an unreadable face.<br>Stella is always thinking to herself silently.<br><br>\u25c6Teacher <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/6e9c67d1ba7b315c589ba6f9bb610a18.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><br>A male teacher at the children\u2019s home where Allen lives.<br>He is searching for something\u2015but what, and why...?<br><br>\u25c6White Rabbit <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/b3de4d3db2aac9e3b57080d1bd9d42d4.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><br>The White Rabbit technically fills the role of Allen\u2019s guide.<br>However, he seems to have little interest in actually \u201cguiding\u201d.<br><br>\u25c6Cheshire Cat <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/524850/extras/b0c862989853135c3a1e4f7a9d00192a.avif?t=1573102865\" width=96 height=96 /></span><br>The Cheshire Cat is another character who guides Allen along on his journey.<br>He has the ability to appear and disappear at will, and is characterized by his very peculiar manner of speaking.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"30db85b6c87eaddf4573698f99905cb0b407cbe1.jpg","localized_name":"Chow Down","name":"Chow Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/30db85b6c87eaddf4573698f99905cb0b407cbe1.jpg"},{"icon":"b63fb3e627920966544aaa14dfc70aa7bbb0540d.jpg","localized_name":"Man's Needs","name":"Man's Needs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/b63fb3e627920966544aaa14dfc70aa7bbb0540d.jpg"},{"icon":"72c14c9d7032b5ca64b5624140dce089facb840b.jpg","localized_name":"Stellar Performance","name":"Stellar Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/72c14c9d7032b5ca64b5624140dce089facb840b.jpg"},{"icon":"8af495eca6a13d94e9534363b31effd11dd44491.jpg","localized_name":"NuSkillz","name":"NuSkillz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/8af495eca6a13d94e9534363b31effd11dd44491.jpg"},{"icon":"f0d5a2f032b0046d1b5f39da1d8452d70bd69128.jpg","localized_name":"The Color Red","name":"The Color Red","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/f0d5a2f032b0046d1b5f39da1d8452d70bd69128.jpg"},{"icon":"331f34de186a5621db4e8d5052c70baa4e2366d4.jpg","localized_name":"Crying Wolf","name":"Crying Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/331f34de186a5621db4e8d5052c70baa4e2366d4.jpg"},{"icon":"cd5051c27d6f47c2450154a897471526b5d454c7.jpg","localized_name":"Poison Apple","name":"Poison Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/524850/cd5051c27d6f47c2450154a897471526b5d454c7.jpg"},{"icon":"edd0235acae6f37a91e14c33f4d1eac4df226d2b.jpg","localized_name":"Recipient of Love","name":"Recipient of Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images